# SHA-256 of the certificate that signs the published release APKs (v0.27.0 - v0.28.1),
# i.e. what is installed on players' phones. Android only installs an update signed with the
# same certificate, so tools/verify_apk.sh fails a build signed with anything else.
# Public value (it is in every APK). See docs/DECISIONS.md #141 before changing it.
